---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Tax Representation" description="IRS audit defense, Offers in Compromise, penalty abatement, and collection alternatives. Ex-IRS veteran representing you before the IRS.">
  <section class="section-padding">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="mb-6">Tax Representation</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-muted font-sans mb-8">Get an ex-IRS veteran to represent you before the IRS. Nitasha has spent years on the other side of the table — now she's on yours.</p>

      <div class="prose font-sans">
        <h3 class="mt-12 mb-4">Services Include</h3>
        <p class="mb-4">Audit defense and examination representation, Offers in Compromise (OIC), Installment Agreements and Partial Pay Installment Agreements (PPIA), Currently Not Collectible (CNC) status, penalty abatement and interest abatement requests, IRS Appeals representation, and CDP hearing representation.</p>

        <h3 class="mt-12 mb-4">Why It Matters</h3>
        <p class="mb-4">As an Enrolled Agent — and a former IRS Case Advocate and Tax Compliance Officer — Nitasha understands how IRS examiners and collection officers evaluate cases. She uses that insider knowledge to build the strongest possible case for resolution.</p>

        <h3 class="mt-12 mb-4">How It Works</h3>
        <p class="mb-4">We start with a consultation to understand your situation, then take over communication with the IRS on your behalf. You get a dedicated advocate who navigates the process while keeping you informed at every step.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Get Representation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
